    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "en": "Initializes the process handle and starts the process. If the process is\nsuccessfully spawned, this function will return 0. Otherwise, the\nnegative error code corresponding to the reason it couldn’t spawn is\nreturned. Note that either way-success or failure–you must eventually call\n",
      "ja": "プロセスハンドルを初期化し、プロセスを開始します。起動に成功すると0を返します。失敗すると、起動できなかった理由に対応する負のエラーコードを返します。他のlibuvの初期化関数とは異なり、成功・失敗のいずれの場合も、最終的に次の関数を呼び出す必要があります: "
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "en": " to close the handle again before freeing the memory of\nthe handle, unlike other the other init functions in libuv.",
      "ja": "。ハンドルのメモリーを解放する前に、この関数でハンドルを閉じてください。"
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "en": "Possible reasons for failing to spawn would include (but not be limited to)\nthe file to execute not existing, not having permissions to use the setuid or\nsetgid specified, or not having enough memory to allocate for the new\nprocess.",
